{"id":"bb0e606138cd791a","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md","title":"Orthonormal Basis","display":"df-orthonormal-basis — Orthonormal Basis","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-orthonormal-basis","aliases":["58-df-orthonormal-basis","Orthonormal Basis","ONB","Hilbert Basis"],"display":"df-orthonormal-basis — Orthonormal Basis","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-orthonormal-basis"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-orthonormal-basis</span><span>Orthonormal Basis</span><span>ONB</span><span>Hilbert Basis</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-orthonormal-basis — Orthonormal Basis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle,I,e\\in V\">\\(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle,I,e\\in V\\)</span> (Hilbert space, index set, and indexed family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2\\)</span> (Hilbert-space predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OrthonormalFamily}_S,\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{OrthonormalFamily}_S,\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}basis} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrthonormalFamily}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,I,H)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle e(i),e(j)\\rangle=\\delta_{ij}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}basis} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrthonormalFamily}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,I,H)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle e(i),e(j)\\rangle=\\delta_{ij}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}basis} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OrthonormalFamily}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle x,e(i)\\rangle=0)\\right)\\to\\langle x,x\\rangle=0\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}basis} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OrthonormalFamily}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle x,e(i)\\rangle=0)\\right)\\to\\langle x,x\\rangle=0\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The final clause says that the orthogonal complement of the family is trivial; in a Hilbert space this is equivalent to density of its linear span.</li>\n<li>Maximal orthonormal families and complete orthonormal families are equivalent, but maximality is a theorem rather than part of this definition.</li>\n<li>A Hilbert space is separable exactly when it has a countable orthonormal basis.</li>\n<li>The completeness clause uses definiteness of the displayed inner product, rather than a free symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_H\">\\(0_H\\)</span> whose vector-space witness was hidden by the two-place Hilbert-space projection.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2$ (Hilbert-space predicates, see [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle,I,e\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\subseteq V^5\\cup V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OrthonormalFamily}_S,\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}basis} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrthonormalFamily}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(e,I,H)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\forall j\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\langle e(i),e(j)\\rangle=\\delta_{ij}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}orthonormal\\text{-}basis} \\vdash \\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{OrthonormalFamily}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall i\\in I\\;(\\langle x,e(i)\\rangle=0)\\right)\\to\\langle x,x\\rangle=0\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"0_H","display":false}],"bytes":2107,"backlinks":[{"id":"633f67d630a481ae","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Complete orthonormal basis properties are defined in [[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md]]"},{"id":"f9fa657af9512258","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;\\mathcal H,B)$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis]])"},{"id":"bdffe105700c69e0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S$ (orthonormal-basis predicate, see [[58-df-orthonormal-basis]])"},{"id":"b4b5a11e6fceca54","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OrthonormalBasis}_S(e,I;H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)$（见 [[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md]]）"},{"id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-927","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-orthonormal-basis.md|58-df-orthonormal-basis]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["b70ce791d5b1a19b","36d7463d215be751"]}